{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfQdaaqJPdQGAbNDo5Pjk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"TicketBay refunds an early-bird ticket like any other ticket. The refund uses the discounted price that you paid.\n\n- **Refund amount:** You get back the early-bird price that you paid, minus a 2% refund fee. The minimum fee is €0.50.\n- **Discount:** TicketBay does not take the early-bird discount back when you cancel. It also does not add the discount to your refund.\n- **Refund window:** You can cancel until the event starts.\n- **Service fee:** You do not get the service fee back.\n\n**Example:** A €50.00 event costs €45.00 with the early-bird discount (10% off). If you cancel, you get €45.00 − €0.90 fee = **€44.10**.\n\nGroup discounts and discount codes use the same rule. The refund is always based on what you paid after all discounts.\n\nFor context: the early-bird discount applies when you book at least 30 days before the event.\n\nSource: TicketBay's refund policy and early-bird help pages (`help/refund-policy.md`, `help/early-bird-and-discounts.md`)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":704,"cache_read_input_tokens":27639,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":704},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c305cbc7-20e5-445b-a770-fec701f63933","uuid":"bff3e47b-6d65-46bc-b548-07fcf96bc36d","timestamp":"2026-09-25T18:28:49.713Z","request_id":"req_011CfQdaaLHGhjHvRAW56eSd"}
